  The article says the starch plant's waste was released into the Sithar stream and ethanol plant waste also into the stream; the reel_script and slides_spec say 'ஆலையை மூடக் கோரி' and the caption says 'ஆலையை மூடக் கோரி', which matches, but the reel_script says the ethanol unit 'முகாசிப்புதூர் ஊராட்சியில் உள்ள அதே ஆலையின் எத்தனால் பிரிவு' while the article says 'முகாசிப்புதூர் ஊராட்சியில் உள்ள இதே ஆலையின் மற்றொரு பிரிவான எத்தனால் ஆலை' — the location (Mugasipudur panchayat) is correct but the ethanol unit is described as 'பிரிவு' in the caption and reel, consistent with the article, so this is not an error; however the reel_script states the starch plant is in 'பூனாச்சி ஊராட்சி' while the article's starch plant is also in Poonachi panchayat, so no conflict there.
  The reel_script omits that the electricity connections of both the starch and ethanol plants were cut off and the ethanol plant's key sections were sealed in a way that is described only partially; the reel_script does mention both, so this is acceptable.
  The reel_script says 'எத்தனால் ஆலையின் முக்கிய பிரிவுகளுக்கு சீல் வைக்கப்பட்டது' which matches the article.
  The slides_spec 'அடுத்து என்ன?' slide lists 'மின் இணைப்பு துண்டிக்கப்பட்டு சீல் வைக்கப்பட்டது' as a single line that mixes the electricity cut-off (for both plants) with sealing (for the ethanol plant only), merging two facts into one sentence.
  The slides_spec 'என்ன நடந்தது?' slide says the protest was 'பூனாச்சி, நத்தமேடு பிரிவில் நடைபெற்றது' which matches the article, but the caption and reel do not mention that the protest was joined by residents of Ramachandrapuram, which is only partially reflected; the reel_script does name the villages, so this is not a problem.
